Title: Two Values That Refuse Differently.
Note: LAW-SUFFICIENCY-1, E2. A research fixture, off the gate: both definitions apply and neither overrides the other; the first value in clause order divides by zero, the second overflows.
§1 Define r as 1 divided by 0.
§2 Define r as 9223372036854775807 plus 1.
§3 Say r.
